OL,2,V55555555CBIG BANKS CUT
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CBASE RATES TO 10%
OL,5, The Budget has sparked a cautious 0.5%
OL,6, cut to 10% in interest rates by the big
OL,7, banks but homeowners must wait for
OL,8, their mortgages to come down.
OL,10, After the decision to slash the Govt's
OL,11, borrowing target next year, markets
OL,12, were expecting the authorities to take
OL,13, the plunge with a full 1% cut to 9.5%.
OL,15, Halifax Building Society chief John
OL,16, Spalding said borrowers might have to
OL,17, wait until there is a further cut.
OL,19, The Government is keeping a close eye
OL,20, on sterling which strengthened despite
OL,21, the base rate reduction.
OL,23,F]DFrom 18-03-87 / teletextarchive.com
