OL,2,V55555555CAXE FOR 1,400 AT
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CBR ENGINEERING
OL,4,B
OL,5, British Rail Engineering is to axe
OL,6, 1,400 jobs at Crewe, York and Derby,
OL,7, said Transport Minister David Mitchell.
OL,9, He told the Commons the losses were
OL,10, necessary because of a fall in demand
OL,11, from British Rail for maintenance and
OL,12, repairs to rolling stock.
OL,14, Brel - a wholly owned offshoot of
OL,15, British Rail - is widely seen to be
OL,16, involved in a slimming down operation
OL,17, prior to future privatisation.
OL,19, NUR assistant general-secretary Andy
OL,20, Dodds said: "We are disgusted at this
OL,21, further run-down of British Rail
OL,22, engineering staff."
OL,23,F]DFrom 18-03-87 / teletextarchive.com
